{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act53side", "eventName": "直到大地变成一颗酸橙", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TO-8", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "以决心做邮戳", "storyInfo": "塔妮和安洁莉娜分头行动，一个去往嘉辛塔家，一个赶去阿梅利亚工作的公司。好在她们都赶在了坏结局的前面，事情有了转机。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_deluxeroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$wasteland_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮小姐，请稍等。我去通报一下坎贝尔先生，马上就来。", "name": "管家"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_carpet_normal_fts", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "150,0", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好漂亮的房子......比我想象中的还离谱......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这样的房子都能让你惊叹？所以我才说比起跟你们跑来跑去，只有在我们这里，她才能得到最好的照顾。", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "150,0", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.2}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您就是坎贝尔先生？我是来探望嘉辛塔的——", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多谢关心，嘉辛塔现在很好，请回吧。", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$2"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃......探望可不是光知道她身体状况就行的呀。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$2"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那你还想知道什么？", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮小姐，你也感染了矿石病，难道你的家人就不担心你的身体状况吗？还是说，你其实也是从家里偷跑出来的？", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哼，不懂事的孩子。不珍惜眼前安稳的生活，还要往外跑。", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们永远不知道家人有多爱你们，把你们养这么大付出了多少代价！", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那为了回报你们付出的代价，我们这些孩子又应该做什么呢？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听话，就这么一件事。", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听话，像一件不该折损的财产一样待在家里，是吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "财产......你在胡说些什么！", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难道不是吗？按您说的，成本价越高的孩子就越应该听话，不是吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不知道嘉辛塔对您的“付出”是怎么看的，但我知道我自己的感受。我很感激我的家人，我知道他们在关心我、保护我。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但随着我长大，我的追求总有跟他们的想法相悖的时候，我当然会难过——因为我爱他们，但也爱我自己规划的生活。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果事事符合家人的心意才称得上一个合格的女儿，那我宁愿当一个坏孩子，宁愿得不到他们的认可！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "坎贝尔先生，在您强调自己为嘉辛塔付出多少，多爱她的时候，您有思考过她与您争吵是为了什么吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$2"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不必教训我。", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她与您争吵是因为她想得到您的认可，因为她很在意您和坎贝尔夫人，她希望能从自己爱的人身上得到支持！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$2"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们不愿支持她，但她总会遇到更多愿意给她支持的人，而那些人不必是她的家人。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......任性的年轻人迟早会付出代价。我不会让你见她的。送客。", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_carpet_normal_fts", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......要不是安洁再三叮嘱我要注意礼貌，我本来也不需要得到您的同意啊，坎贝尔先生。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "150,0", "duration": 1.2, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_vipward", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_020", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘉辛塔小姐，您不能下楼。", "name": "保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我听到楼下有声音......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1"}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_020"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么晚了，不会有人来的。您早点休息吧，已经是深夜了。", "name": "保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorclosequite"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁......塔妮......还有......唉......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_knockwindow"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......谁？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$warm_intro", "key": "$warm_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别唉声叹气啦，快来帮我开窗！", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_openwindow"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_ftrub", "channel": "2"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.2, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 15.0, "vibrato": 10.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "posfrom": "0,60", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 0.3}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮？！你怎么会跑到这里？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇，这是你的房间？完全是一间病房啊，怎么一丁点你自己的东西都没有？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......在我得病之后，这间房间就被改造成便于治疗的病房了。", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的身体怎么样？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "根本不是矿石病的事，医生说是因为昨天没吃饭，再加上被阿梅气到了......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你......还在生阿梅的气啊。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$2"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我当然生气！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她确实骗了我们，让她写十封肉麻的道歉书再全城广播都不过分。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你也看得出来，那个阿什顿部长肯定对阿梅说了什么，她本来就耳根软，还没什么自信——", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不是气这个！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难道你真觉得她一路上说的那些话就只是为了骗我们？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你没看她说那些话时的样子？哪个骗子骗人之后还会嘿嘿傻笑的？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她明明就是在说自己想做却没胆量做的事情，而且她明明就做得到！鬼才信那个阿什顿的话！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我之前还好奇她为什么总是这副唯唯诺诺的样子，现在我总算知道了，全是纵贯红土打压她的结果！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那你生气的地方是......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她远比自己认为的更有担当，也更有野心，她甚至已经想好了要去南境收集数据，研发完全属于自己的尖端通讯技术！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她不知道我有多......羡慕她......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘉辛塔？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "得病之后，父母渐渐不再让我出门，后来更是把我送去了疗养中心。为了打发时间，我就开始学习各种技能。", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#5$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对啊，你在这种情况下还考了那么多资格证，已经很不容易了。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是我拥有的只是一沓证书，从来没有实践过！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "驾驶证是用操作模拟器考的，学习驮兽驯养用的是木头做的机械驮兽，烘焙糕点的时候我不用自己亲手搅拌，也不被允许接近烤箱......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这些资格证只能用来作为父母开酒会时的谈资。或许父亲是了解我的，我最擅长的事情就是扮演坎贝尔家知书达理的小姐......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#9$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "打断一下。嘉辛塔，想开车吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？现在？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为好像有人发现我们了——", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast", "volume": 0.5}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——不是现在也得是现在了！我们得去城外躲躲！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 175, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g16_dttsuburb_n", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.0, "yScale": 1.0}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$holiday_intro", "key": "$holiday_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你、你真的确定？我警告过你了，我完全没有摸过真的方向盘，我——", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道，我会陪着你，不用担心。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（咽口水）", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_cardoorc", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_76_i16_3", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "sfrom": 1.0, "sto": 1.0, "sduration": 0.0}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她的目光一一扫过越野车上的每个零件，试图将它们与操作模拟器上显示的东西对应起来——说实话，几乎没有零件能对应上。"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但她闭着眼睛想了想。"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "回忆安洁莉娜和塔妮开车时的样子，回忆自己想要亲手握上方向盘的渴望——"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$sportscarstart", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "xstrength": 2.0, "ystrength": 2.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_driveincar", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.5, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她的手在颤抖。整辆越野车都在颤抖。"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "backgroundTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.0, "yScaleFrom": 1.0, "xScaleTo": 1.15, "yScaleTo": 1.15, "duration": 3.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她深吸了一口气，踩下了油门。越野车缓慢地向前挪动，她不可置信地转头向塔妮确认。"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮只是笑了，没有做任何进一步的指示，但她受到了鼓舞。"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "backgroundTween", "attributes": {"duration": 1.5, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g2_wildhighway_n", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"xstrength": 1.0, "ystrength": 1.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "false", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_carspeedup", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_speedline", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.0, "to": 1.0}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "xstrength": 2.0, "ystrength": 2.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "false", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"xstrength": 1.0, "ystrength": 1.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "false", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "踩下离合，换挡，提速，再踩下离合，换挡，提速......"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘉辛塔·坎贝尔行驶在路上，风吹翻了她的耳朵，她聆听着自己行驶在大地上的声音。"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她发出自己有生以来最疯狂、最开怀的笑声，然后由着它们被自己行驶的速度甩在身后。"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0, "type": "bg", "from": 1.0, "to": 0.0}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_kira", "layer": 1.0, "x": 300.0}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘉辛塔——我就知道——你其实什么都能做得很好——！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_proud", "layer": 1.0, "y": 100.0}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在——我也知道啦——哈哈哈哈——！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_question", "layer": 1.0, "x": 300.0}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "接下来——你想——做什么——", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_angry", "layer": 1.0, "y": 100.0}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要——阿梅——跟我们道歉——！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_musicalnote", "layer": 1.0, "x": 300.0}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好——！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_matter", "layer": 1.0, "y": 80.0}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要——去公司——把她从——无聊的办公室——抓出来——！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_musicalnote", "layer": 1.0, "x": 300.0}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好——！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_shy", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要——我要跟你们——一起去南境！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_cheer", "layer": 1.0, "x": 200.0}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好——！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.0, "xstrength": 1.0, "ystrength": 1.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "false", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 0.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.0, "to": 0.0}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "38_g13_trimountlivingroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这个点了，不知道阿梅是不是还在加班......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$1"}, {"id": 265, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，怎么这么多人？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crowdrun"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_1260_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "false", "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$mist_intro", "key": "$mist_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "警报怎么没响？人都进通讯塔了！", "name": "紧张的公司职员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "天知道为什么！之前造成大断连给我们添了那么多乱子，现在还要逞能？", "name": "无奈的公司职员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1260_1#1$1"}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你没听说吗？私底下都在传，是阿什顿部长故意用那个小姑娘的技术试错，出事了也好推卸责任......", "name": "紧张的公司职员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "行了，阿什顿部长已经赶过去了，我们也赶紧叫人，别让那小姑娘在工程总监来之前把塔修好，不然宣传案可就白做了！", "name": "无奈的公司职员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1260_1#1$1"}, {"id": 284, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "duration": 0.7, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "250,0", "duration": 0.8, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "进通讯塔？......阿梅？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#7$1"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g10_dtttowertop", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "天色渐亮。"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "本应坐在办公室里把一封邮件翻来覆去发几百遍的阿纳缇，此时坐在大铁屯通讯塔的上层通路，一心一意地看着眼前的电路板。"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大铁屯临近南境，大气源石浓度的变化复杂，她几乎在这里检测了一整夜的数据，抬起头的时候，她甚至没意识到太阳已经升了起来。"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔......好亮。终于调试完模块了，现在只需要把它连到通讯核心里，再放到——", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿梅利亚！你到底在做什么！你不想要自己的工作了吗！", "name": "急切的喊声"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在立刻下来，不准动通讯塔，听见没！", "name": "急切的喊声"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿、阿什顿部长！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1"}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "糟糕......我的动作还是太慢了，得趁他们上来抓我之前把该做的事做完。", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#11$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁她们可能很快就要启程了，再快一点，再快一点——", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#11$1"}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不然就赶不上了，不然这么高的塔都白、白爬了！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#11$1"}, {"id": 315, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_222"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g11_dtttowerfoot", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.05, "yScale": 1.05, "y": 15.0}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啧，怎么安保部队还没来，都是吃干萝卜的吗！", "name": "阿什顿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_222"}, {"id": 322, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "算了，我还对付不了一个动不动就哭的小姑娘吗？我自己去把她——", "name": "阿什顿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_222"}, {"id": 323, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等一下。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_222"}, {"id": 325, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿什顿部长，你要做什么？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1"}, {"id": 329, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_222"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我？我......唉，只是想阻止阿梅利亚做傻事啊！", "name": "阿什顿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_222"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "傻事？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_222"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊。我好不容易从管理层手里保下她的工作，我是同情她母亲过世，父亲又在异地，她一个人来这里打拼不容易。", "name": "阿什顿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_222"}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结果倒好，她私自给自己开通了安保系统的权限，在通讯塔待了一夜，怕是要做不利于纵贯——不利于她前途的事啊......", "name": "阿什顿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_222"}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是她的朋友，你应该知道阿梅利亚怕高，她现在一个人在塔上孤立无援，也是可怜。你快把她劝下来吧？", "name": "阿什顿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_222"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "劝下来？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duraiton": 1.0}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "BackgroundTween", "attributes": {"yFrom": 15.0, "duration": 2.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "gridbg", "attributes": {"imagegroup": "53_g16_sunnyday_L1/53_g16_sunnyday_R1/53_g16_sunnyday_L2/53_g16_sunnyday_R2", "solidwidth": "1280/1280/1280/1280", "solidheight": "720/720/720/720", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "largebgtween", "attributes": {"duration": 30.0, "yFrom": 300.0, "yTo": 250.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "backgroundTween", "attributes": {"duration": 15.0, "yTo": 0.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$newhope01_intro", "key": "$newhope01_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁莉娜抬头。"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "刚升起的太阳照在阿梅利亚永远梳不直的头发上，显得她比安洁莉娜印象里的更加瘦小。"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她坐在通讯塔上层的通路上一动不动，或许真如阿什顿部长说的那样，阿梅利亚此刻正在害怕。"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但安洁莉娜了解她的朋友。"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这一路上，这个一直冒冒失失、慌慌张张的孩子，只在一个时候会呈现出这样坚定的、认真的背影——"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在她工作的时候。"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而这也意味着，安洁莉娜还没有向阿梅利亚问出的问题——阿梅利亚究竟还去不去南境——已经得到了答案。"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "largebg", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#24$1"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g11_dtttowerfoot", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白了。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#24$1"}, {"id": 365, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_222"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "太好了。放心，安保部队很快就会到了，只要你先把她劝下来——", "name": "阿什顿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_222"}, {"id": 367, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "action": "shake", "power": 5.0, "times": 50.0, "duration": 0.3}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？我的腿......", "name": "阿什顿"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "action": "shake", "power": 5.0, "times": 50.0, "duration": 0.6}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "连胳膊也......怎么突然这么重？中风？！", "name": "阿什顿"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_groundrumbling", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.8, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"xstrength": 2.0, "ystrength": 2.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "false", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$wallemdtown_intro", "key": "$wallemdtown_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿什顿回头，发现不止是自己，连已经赶到现场的第一批职员和安保人员，也都被未知的力量牵绊住了手脚。"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而眼前的沃尔珀却轻盈地跳上了楼梯上的金属扶手，露出笑容。"}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心，阿什顿部长，你离中风还远着呢。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 386, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，想必这些年你已经习惯在纵贯红土公司里，轻轻飘飘地走来走去了吧？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 387, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "感受一下重力真正的力量，如何？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1"}, {"id": 389, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.0, "xstrength": 1.0, "ystrength": 1.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}